    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Andre Robichaud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109479473725281475804/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgwTFbYLJJqnmG-4Og8_lavsn0opXIFT4MhVPfi1IjMcZcAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We received your painting, \"Treasures of Time,\" to celebrate our 50th wedding anniversary. It's magnificent! What talent you have for painting trees and the forest! It feels so realistic, we feel as if we're walking right through it, especially since you incorporated bark from our own birch trees. We were deeply moved. The trees, with their root systems, are a powerful symbol of a resilient and caring family. We also want to highlight the beauty of the text that accompanies your artwork. Thank you so much! Rita Côté, André Robichaud",
        "time": 1767709637,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Simon Gadoury",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101204429563887120187/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJWVZN8698DHRWMqejR92WOm9f3ukbN9PEWXKU60Xlcpb4vsQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Chantal is an incredible artist! I bought a painting from her for my office and everyone's been talking about it. I'm very happy with it.",
        "time": 1762776338,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Isabelle Lafleche",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102876205453130717802/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZda8A9p-aly9be-xKWPFi0itrDgsJsVZge0QGMRLRso5_aQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Chantal was very attentive to our needs and preferences, and offered helpful suggestions. The result of our painting is simply stunning. Chantal is a generous and talented artist. I highly recommend her.",
        "time": 1764022734,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
